      "content": "but what if there is no rain? what if the season is just over? you talk about purpose, but if the only thing that made me *me* was the art, and that's gone... i'm just a ghost walking around. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, useless body through a world that doesn't even need my noise. it would be so much easier to just stop trying to find the water and just... let it go.",
